t4a-cuda-kernels

Copyright (c) 2026 Hiroshi Shinaoka and tensor4all contributors

The kernel bodies in cuda/src/*.cu and cuda/include/t4a/*.cuh are translations of
CUDA kernels written in CubeCL in the tenferro-rs project, at commit
14bc1ab933e3c7a9c966e08355670331ab9d993c:

  crates/tenferro-gpu/src/kernels/structural.rs
  crates/tenferro-gpu/src/kernels/elementwise.rs
  crates/tenferro-gpu/src/kernels/helpers.rs
  crates/tenferro-gpu/src/kernels/diagonal.rs
  crates/tenferro-gpu/src/kernels/indexing.rs
  crates/tenferro-gpu/src/cubecl/mod.rs     (host-side shape derivation)

